WEBVTT

00:07.616 --> 00:09.376
[If you don't turn yourself in,
your limbs will rot and you'll die]

00:37.833 --> 00:41.233
[All characters and events are fictional,
and any resemblance is coincidental]

00:41.233 --> 00:43.867
[Scenes with children and animals were filmed
safely under professional supervision]

00:43.867 --> 00:47.000
[Establishing Law and Order]
Mr. Lee Yong Woo, have you been well?

00:47.000 --> 00:49.833
[Compliance Required]
Why didn't you come yesterday?

00:49.833 --> 00:52.900
Something urgent came up.

00:52.900 --> 00:55.867
Were you waiting for me?

00:55.867 --> 00:57.344
Something urgent?

00:57.344 --> 00:58.496
[Confession is the beginning of forgiveness,
and forgiveness opens the door to salvation]

00:58.496 --> 01:01.233
Guess this isn't all that urgent to you.

01:01.233 --> 01:02.833
Well, why would it be?

01:02.833 --> 01:06.267
The statute of limitations
has already expired anyway.

01:06.267 --> 01:09.533
Right, nothing urgent about it.

01:09.533 --> 01:13.033
The more important something is,
the less you should rush it.

01:13.033 --> 01:14.667
Important?

01:14.667 --> 01:16.704
This is

01:16.704 --> 01:19.267
like my life's mission.

01:20.233 --> 01:22.467
"Mission", huh?

01:22.467 --> 01:24.067
Sounds impressive.

01:24.967 --> 01:26.400
What do you mean?

01:26.400 --> 01:28.433
A life's mission?

01:28.433 --> 01:30.900
People like me don't have anything like that.

01:30.900 --> 01:35.767
How did you end up getting into that,

01:35.767 --> 01:38.133
your life's mission?

01:44.033 --> 01:46.633
What got me started?

01:53.767 --> 01:56.833
Calling won't wake her up.

01:56.833 --> 01:58.733
Go get questioned.

01:58.733 --> 01:59.767
On what?

01:59.767 --> 02:00.767
[Episode 3]

02:00.767 --> 02:04.533
The assault on Jeon Kyeong Ho.
That's my jurisdiction.

02:08.067 --> 02:11.367
Are you seriously
going to lock me up over that?

02:11.968 --> 02:15.900
You think the case is going
to be handed to you now?

02:16.933 --> 02:19.133
It's already mine.

02:19.800 --> 02:20.800
What?

02:20.800 --> 02:22.633
I told you.

02:22.633 --> 02:24.900
I'd take it back.

02:24.900 --> 02:26.208
You,

02:26.208 --> 02:27.833
and the case.

02:31.100 --> 02:32.933
Hey.

02:32.933 --> 02:36.867
Forget about petty things
like asking to make a phone call.

02:36.867 --> 02:39.033
Just for once,

02:39.033 --> 02:42.266
say, "Please help me."

02:42.266 --> 02:43.300
Jeez.

02:43.300 --> 02:45.967
Then I'll take care of everything.

02:57.133 --> 02:58.522
Tae Joo.

02:59.367 --> 03:01.000
Kang Tae Joo.

03:03.067 --> 03:04.544
We can

03:04.544 --> 03:06.533
take that punk down together.

03:08.767 --> 03:10.867
You and me, we do this together.

03:23.800 --> 03:25.500
Didn't I already tell you?

03:26.200 --> 03:27.936
Cut the "we" crap.

03:27.936 --> 03:30.800
I don't want anything to do with you.

03:33.167 --> 03:35.867
You're gonna help me?

03:36.900 --> 03:38.567
You?

03:40.200 --> 03:42.333
What a joke.

03:43.067 --> 03:44.533
Prosecutor Cha Si Young.

03:44.533 --> 03:47.400
You really wanna help me?

03:47.400 --> 03:49.300
Get your face

03:49.300 --> 03:51.467
out of my sight.

03:57.333 --> 04:00.033
If that's what you want, fine.

04:04.967 --> 04:09.867
[Police officer arrested]
The victim needs eight weeks to recover.

04:09.867 --> 04:11.700
What are you going to do about this?

04:13.767 --> 04:15.488
Is there

04:15.488 --> 04:18.733
any way to handle this quietly?

04:20.800 --> 04:25.133
I even considered indicting him immediately,

04:25.133 --> 04:29.300
but with the recent serial murders,
public trust in the police is at rock bottom.

04:29.300 --> 04:31.767
It just didn't feel right.

04:32.900 --> 04:34.533
That's right.

04:36.733 --> 04:39.733
Let's just take his resignation
quietly and end it.

04:40.867 --> 04:43.933
Yeah, that sounds best.

04:43.933 --> 04:45.667
- Do that.
- Chief!

04:45.667 --> 04:47.700
You still don't get it even now?

04:47.700 --> 04:50.067
Eight weeks means jail time, no question.

04:50.067 --> 04:52.400
And jail time means dismissal anyway.

04:55.167 --> 04:56.233
Why aren't you answering?

04:56.233 --> 04:58.767
Please have Detective Kang questioned.

04:58.767 --> 04:59.867
What?

04:59.867 --> 05:01.400
He's still a police officer.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.967
He even saved a woman
from the suspect this time.

05:03.967 --> 05:06.200
So you're asking me to let him off?

05:06.200 --> 05:07.733
No, what I mean is

05:07.733 --> 05:10.733
he's done his job properly
for over ten years.

05:10.733 --> 05:14.100
If you throw someone like that out,
morale among the others will drop.

05:14.100 --> 05:18.133
Chief, honestly,
who'd even want to be a cop then?

05:18.867 --> 05:20.633
Please show some leniency.

05:25.000 --> 05:27.333
Fine, let's do that.

05:27.333 --> 05:31.167
If it makes you uncomfortable
to fire your colleague,

05:31.167 --> 05:32.500
what can we do?

05:32.500 --> 05:34.600
Just follow procedure.

05:35.467 --> 05:39.133
Anyway, Detective Kang Tae Joo is removed
from all investigations, effective today.

05:39.133 --> 05:40.833
Procedure followed.

05:56.986 --> 05:58.202
[Seo Ji Won]

05:59.833 --> 06:02.367
Sun Young, why are you here?

06:07.033 --> 06:09.100
How's Ji Won?

06:09.100 --> 06:10.300
Still unconscious?

06:10.300 --> 06:11.933
I heard

06:12.567 --> 06:15.100
she got hurt
trying to catch the suspect with you.

06:19.200 --> 06:21.367
Seriously,

06:21.367 --> 06:23.633
it's always about that darn suspect.

06:23.633 --> 06:26.400
Why are you only here now?
Where were you back then?

06:28.667 --> 06:30.733
Were you chasing the suspect again?

06:32.567 --> 06:34.867
Come out for a second.

06:40.733 --> 06:42.944
Kang Sun Young, first,

06:42.944 --> 06:45.167
explain what happened to you.

06:45.167 --> 06:49.933
Why were you in the car with him?
And why did he do that to you?

06:51.467 --> 06:53.696
Shouldn't you

06:53.696 --> 06:55.133
ask if I'm okay first?

06:55.133 --> 06:57.067
What's your relationship with that punk?

07:02.067 --> 07:04.100
A student got into a car accident.

07:04.100 --> 07:06.700
So I went to the hospital with him,

07:06.700 --> 07:09.733
and he offered to give me a ride home,
so I just got in.

07:09.733 --> 07:11.463
Then

07:11.463 --> 07:13.400
how does he know about our mother?

07:13.400 --> 07:15.633
You think I told him?

07:16.600 --> 07:20.800
He suddenly started saying weird things,
so I asked to get out, but he got angry.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.900
And then, the accident happened.

07:26.133 --> 07:29.133
Did that guy do anything to you?

07:29.133 --> 07:31.033
No, nothing like that happened.

07:32.600 --> 07:35.833
Jeez, that woman really is something.

07:35.833 --> 07:39.000
Even in death, she's dragging her kids down.

07:40.633 --> 07:42.967
Don't talk about her like that.

07:42.967 --> 07:45.767
Mom did her best for us.

07:46.433 --> 07:48.400
Best?

07:48.400 --> 07:50.633
You call that the best?

07:50.633 --> 07:53.967
That woman left you when you were sick
and went off with another man.

07:53.967 --> 07:56.533
- You don't know what you're talking about!
- Tae Joo, stop!

08:43.100 --> 08:46.000
Sun Young, just hang in there
a little longer.

09:08.267 --> 09:09.867
Sorry.

09:23.067 --> 09:25.767
He told me to apply for a transfer.

09:27.500 --> 09:30.500
He kept threatening me with my son,

09:30.500 --> 09:32.467
so I had no choice.

09:33.700 --> 09:35.633
Yeah, I see.

09:37.267 --> 09:38.848
It was

09:38.848 --> 09:40.800
about seven years ago?

09:40.800 --> 09:42.330
Everyone from the office

09:42.330 --> 09:44.867
went on a company outing.

09:46.500 --> 09:48.256
Back then,

09:48.256 --> 09:50.333
Mr. Cha, who didn't even have kids,

09:50.333 --> 09:53.733
got along so well with my son.

09:56.467 --> 09:59.500
He treated him like his own nephew.

09:59.500 --> 10:01.333
But

10:02.300 --> 10:05.400
he'd even torture my son mercilessly.

10:05.400 --> 10:07.367
Is that punk even human?

10:13.567 --> 10:15.520
Jeez,

10:15.520 --> 10:18.233
I've been talking too much about myself.

10:18.233 --> 10:20.933
You must have
a lot on your mind too, Detective Kang.

10:20.933 --> 10:22.567
No, it's all right.

10:23.467 --> 10:26.100
Isn't it ironic?

10:26.100 --> 10:28.608
We're the ones who drove out Cha Si Young,

10:28.608 --> 10:31.033
and now we are in trouble.

10:35.400 --> 10:37.033
It's probably just a coincidence.

10:37.033 --> 10:39.267
Do you really think so?

10:40.700 --> 10:42.784
Cha Si Young

10:42.784 --> 10:45.133
is a horrible man.

10:45.133 --> 10:48.533
He'll use any means to get what he wants.

10:48.533 --> 10:51.700
Try not to go up against him if you can.

10:51.700 --> 10:53.632
Otherwise,

10:53.632 --> 10:55.867
the one who'll get hurt
is you, Detective Kang.

10:59.000 --> 11:01.433
Don't worry about me.

11:01.433 --> 11:03.433
I don't care

11:04.467 --> 11:06.533
about means or methods, either.

11:10.667 --> 11:15.600
[Modako]

11:15.600 --> 11:17.467
Welcome!

11:17.467 --> 11:20.333
It's an honor to have someone
as distinguished as you here.

11:21.533 --> 11:22.733
This way, please.

11:22.733 --> 11:24.433
Yes, this way.

11:36.567 --> 11:38.200
Here.

11:41.333 --> 11:44.000
If I get caught, I'm dead.

11:45.167 --> 11:47.833
Let's call your debt to me even with this.

11:52.300 --> 11:54.367
Which one of those two?

11:56.133 --> 11:57.967
Both of those punks.

12:02.200 --> 12:04.967
Please visit us often.

12:06.967 --> 12:10.067
[Modako Club VIP Pass]

12:10.067 --> 12:12.633
Bring another glass here.

12:12.633 --> 12:14.267
Hey!

12:17.568 --> 12:20.900
Alright, you guys talk.

12:22.033 --> 12:25.952
You're such a decent man.

12:25.952 --> 12:28.100
So you must've been shocked.

12:31.967 --> 12:34.833
So, what about that punk?

12:34.833 --> 12:37.333
We can throw him in jail, right?

12:37.333 --> 12:39.667
Of course, that's nothing.

12:40.864 --> 12:46.733
But I heard that woman filed
a complaint against me. How do we...

12:48.467 --> 12:52.400
That's why I'm asking.
Why did you hit a woman?

12:52.400 --> 12:56.000
I'm sorry. I just lost it in anger
before I knew it.

12:56.733 --> 12:58.800
Then there's no other way.

12:58.800 --> 13:01.000
You'll have to admit
you were having an affair.

13:01.000 --> 13:02.800
What? An affair?

13:02.800 --> 13:06.400
Your mistress, Kang Sun Young
has been demanding you get a divorce,

13:06.400 --> 13:08.567
but you refused to do it.

13:08.567 --> 13:11.500
So during an argument,
things escalated into an accident.

13:11.500 --> 13:15.867
Now, holding a grudge,
she's claiming you assaulted her.

13:16.733 --> 13:19.167
But my wife's going to kill me.

13:20.233 --> 13:23.600
Sir, you really don't understand women.

13:24.900 --> 13:26.900
She won't kill you.

13:36.400 --> 13:41.733
Jeez, your back always acts up like this.
What should we do?

13:41.733 --> 13:44.900
When you get old,
everything just starts breaking down.

13:44.900 --> 13:48.333
First you fooled around
with a married man, now what?

13:48.333 --> 13:50.700
You tried to replace me, his lawful wife?

13:50.700 --> 13:54.867
How can you even call yourself a teacher?

13:54.867 --> 13:57.467
What are you talking about? Let go!

13:57.467 --> 13:59.600
Don't you dare deny it!

13:59.600 --> 14:03.467
You're the daughter of a bar hostess.
No wonder you act the same.

14:03.467 --> 14:05.733
What else would you have learned?

14:05.733 --> 14:08.133
She's the daughter of a bar hostess?

14:12.600 --> 14:14.867
Sun Young!

14:15.600 --> 14:17.700
Oh my, Sun Young!

14:17.700 --> 14:19.767
What's all this about?

14:19.767 --> 14:21.500
What are you doing?

14:21.500 --> 14:23.800
What? Why?

14:23.800 --> 14:27.133
Can't I do this much to the mistress
who slept with my husband?

14:27.133 --> 14:28.200
W-What?

14:28.200 --> 14:30.400
She's a bar hostess' daughter.

14:31.290 --> 14:33.833
No...

14:33.833 --> 14:36.933
Mother, it's not true.

14:36.933 --> 14:38.267
It's not true, Mother.

14:38.267 --> 14:40.367
It's really not true.

14:41.200 --> 14:44.033
Mother?

14:44.033 --> 14:45.600
Oh dear, Mother!

14:45.600 --> 14:47.267
You've got such a fine daughter-in-law.

14:47.267 --> 14:49.567
Oh my, isn't she impressive?

14:49.567 --> 14:53.000
Mother, it's not true.

14:57.100 --> 14:59.700
Mother, I swear it's not true.

15:02.767 --> 15:05.533
Break up with Ki Beom.

15:06.733 --> 15:08.333
Mother...

15:08.333 --> 15:12.400
They say a woman's fate
takes after her mother's.

15:12.400 --> 15:14.767
I shouldn't just brush it off.

15:15.667 --> 15:18.867
Mother, what she said earlier isn't true.

15:18.867 --> 15:20.567
Please believe me.

15:21.733 --> 15:23.600
Your mother was like that too.

15:23.600 --> 15:27.000
Men flocked to her even when she did nothing.

15:27.000 --> 15:31.533
She didn't live like that from the beginning.

15:31.533 --> 15:33.633
After your father passed away,

15:33.633 --> 15:37.567
she had to raise you somehow,
so that's how it ended up.

15:39.933 --> 15:42.233
I'm afraid

15:42.233 --> 15:46.867
you might even take after her
in bringing misfortune to your husband.

15:46.867 --> 15:49.533
That's what scares me the most.

15:56.533 --> 15:58.367
Sun Young.

16:01.800 --> 16:05.167
Please let Ki Beom go.

16:05.167 --> 16:08.067
I'm begging you, okay?

16:17.400 --> 16:23.533
[Kangseng Bookstore]

16:23.533 --> 16:27.467
[Muwon Photo Studio]

16:28.900 --> 16:32.000
Sun Young would look beautiful
in a wedding dress too.

16:32.000 --> 16:34.800
Sun Young will stay
at a relative's place for a while.

16:34.800 --> 16:37.000
Nothing's wrong, I hope.

16:41.178 --> 16:42.667
Sir, this way.

16:42.667 --> 16:44.200
Oh, you're totally wasted.

16:44.200 --> 16:45.733
How come you can hold your liquor so well?

16:45.733 --> 16:48.667
Of course, I can.

16:48.667 --> 16:49.833
Hey, wait, wait.

16:49.833 --> 16:51.000
Stop right there.

16:51.000 --> 16:53.800
Hey, wait. I'm paying today!

16:53.800 --> 16:56.733
Alright.

16:56.733 --> 16:58.464
Right here.

16:58.464 --> 17:00.832
Darn it. Alright.

17:01.567 --> 17:03.300
Here.

17:03.300 --> 17:05.567
[Modako Club VIP Pass]

17:06.433 --> 17:08.067
Thank you!

17:10.700 --> 17:12.500
Here.

17:12.500 --> 17:14.100
Thank you, sir!

17:15.233 --> 17:16.567
You're really generous!

17:16.567 --> 17:19.333
Hey, what's your boss doing?

17:19.333 --> 17:22.067
The guests are leaving.

17:22.067 --> 17:24.567
Hey, why the boss?

17:24.567 --> 17:27.967
Oh, it's fine, man.
I'm close with the owner here.

17:27.967 --> 17:29.400
Oh, really?

17:29.400 --> 17:31.767
Go call him over!

17:31.767 --> 17:33.533
- Go call him right away!
- Yes, sir.

17:33.533 --> 17:35.100
Mr. Park!

17:35.100 --> 17:37.933
Oh my, Mr. Jeon!

17:37.933 --> 17:40.500
Is everything alright here?

17:40.500 --> 17:43.233
Good, good.

17:43.233 --> 17:47.967
Thanks to you, Mr. Park,
I had a great time again today!

17:48.767 --> 17:51.467
I'm leaving!

17:51.467 --> 17:54.500
- Bye, sir!
- Goodbye, sir.

17:54.500 --> 17:56.900
I'll be back tomorrow too.

17:56.900 --> 17:58.200
See you again.

17:58.200 --> 18:00.633
Come again, sir!

18:00.633 --> 18:04.367
Is that punk out of his mind?

18:12.833 --> 18:15.700
That nephew of the county governor

18:15.700 --> 18:18.433
is basically living here for free booze.

18:18.433 --> 18:20.533
Anyway, rich people are always the worst.

18:20.533 --> 18:23.533
How long do we have to keep babying him?

18:23.533 --> 18:26.300
Cleaning up after him is one thing,
but this is too much.

18:26.300 --> 18:28.133
Cleaning up what?

18:30.400 --> 18:32.133
I mean...

18:32.933 --> 18:35.000
I'm the boss here,

18:35.000 --> 18:37.400
and that punk acting out
in front of everyone...

18:38.067 --> 18:40.700
It's embarrassing even
for my employees to see.

18:46.700 --> 18:48.567
Darn it.

18:49.300 --> 18:51.400
Why does the booze taste like this?

18:51.400 --> 18:52.533
Are you still watering it down?

18:52.533 --> 18:54.300
No way!

18:54.300 --> 18:57.300
Since I got suspended back then,
I've never done that again.

18:57.300 --> 18:59.633
With all the customers
you've introduced to me,

18:59.633 --> 19:02.433
do you really think I'd disgrace you?

19:02.433 --> 19:05.067
- Really?
- Of course.

19:06.067 --> 19:08.300
Does it not suit your taste?

19:09.933 --> 19:13.500
Hold on. I'll bring you something else.

19:50.333 --> 19:52.700
Si Young, what about this?

19:52.700 --> 19:55.200
The most expensive bottle we've got...

20:00.767 --> 20:03.000
You little...

20:05.867 --> 20:07.500
What the hell is this?

20:09.133 --> 20:11.367
Are you bugging me?

20:11.367 --> 20:12.567
How dare you!

20:12.567 --> 20:14.200
It wasn't me.

20:15.567 --> 20:18.667
It's a misunderstanding. I swear!

20:19.433 --> 20:21.333
Not you?

20:21.333 --> 20:22.700
Get lost.

20:22.700 --> 20:24.333
Yes, sir.

20:30.433 --> 20:31.968
Si Young,

20:31.968 --> 20:33.767
why would I...

20:34.500 --> 20:37.900
Believe me, it really wasn't me!

20:39.467 --> 20:41.300
Prove it.

20:42.567 --> 20:46.367
Fine, I'll prove it. I'll prove it!

21:08.133 --> 21:09.767
Oh, my head.

21:12.026 --> 21:13.664
Gosh.

21:23.967 --> 21:25.667
- Ji Won.
- Yeah.

21:25.667 --> 21:26.967
Are you feeling a little clearer?

21:26.967 --> 21:29.100
What's wrong with my head?

21:30.067 --> 21:31.648
More importantly,

21:31.648 --> 21:33.733
did they catch the suspect?

21:33.733 --> 21:35.300
Is that what really matters right now?

21:35.300 --> 21:37.800
Did they catch him or not?

21:37.800 --> 21:38.833
Not yet.

21:38.833 --> 21:39.967
Darn it!

21:39.967 --> 21:42.167
Seriously? That's what you're asking
after a narrow escape?

21:42.167 --> 21:44.233
The camera!

21:44.233 --> 21:46.633
Did you find my camera?

21:46.633 --> 21:48.367
What camera?

21:48.367 --> 21:50.500
You didn't find it?

21:58.633 --> 22:01.067
Un Hui, is this even the right place?

22:01.067 --> 22:03.867
I checked with Mr. Park,
and he said it was here.

22:03.867 --> 22:05.600
Then why isn't the camera here?

22:05.600 --> 22:06.967
It's not like it can sink into the ground.

22:06.967 --> 22:09.633
Maybe the suspect took it?

22:09.633 --> 22:10.700
Think about it.

22:10.700 --> 22:13.267
Since it had captured him, do you think
he would've just left it behind?

22:13.267 --> 22:16.367
Darn it, we can't lose that.
That would have been a scoop.

22:18.067 --> 22:21.233
[Modako]

22:33.467 --> 22:36.000
Huh? Where did it go?

22:39.633 --> 22:41.233
Where is it?

22:43.066 --> 22:44.740
Jeez.

22:46.100 --> 22:47.900
What are you doing?

22:52.367 --> 22:54.267
Looking for this?

22:59.800 --> 23:02.033
Got you, you rat!

23:04.600 --> 23:06.233
So?

23:07.533 --> 23:09.133
What?

23:10.633 --> 23:12.233
Who?

23:15.000 --> 23:16.600
Got it.

23:24.700 --> 23:26.467
This is interesting.

23:29.833 --> 23:31.467
Very interesting.

23:32.233 --> 23:36.000
[The suspect's features]

23:36.000 --> 23:40.933
Do you remember anything else
about the suspect's features?

23:40.933 --> 23:43.967
Is it okay to just let him do this?

23:43.967 --> 23:45.900
Prosecutor Cha will go crazy if he finds out.

23:45.900 --> 23:46.933
Leave him be.

23:46.933 --> 23:49.300
[Body type, any weapons used]
He's trying so hard to catch the suspect.

23:49.300 --> 23:52.333
I think I already told you
everything that day.

23:52.333 --> 23:54.000
I didn't see his face.

23:54.000 --> 23:56.600
I told you everything I could remember

23:56.600 --> 23:59.433
about his height, build, and voice.

24:00.733 --> 24:03.133
Sorry for calling you in again.

24:03.133 --> 24:04.533
[The suspect's...]
Anything else coming to mind?

24:04.533 --> 24:06.300
No.

24:06.300 --> 24:08.600
Honestly, I don't even
want to think about it.

24:08.600 --> 24:11.533
Yes, I completely understand.

24:11.533 --> 24:13.167
[The suspect's last words]

24:13.167 --> 24:16.100
Then, just a few more questions.

24:16.100 --> 24:18.033
Ms. Kim Mi Yeon, when the suspect left you,

24:18.033 --> 24:20.200
what did he say before he left?

24:20.200 --> 24:23.400
Couldn't he just ask me directly?

24:25.500 --> 24:28.300
It's just that our situation
is a bit complicated.

24:28.300 --> 24:30.367
I'm sorry.

24:30.367 --> 24:34.200
He said if he caught that woman,
he'd let me go.

24:34.200 --> 24:39.367
But would a man who killed five people
really let me live?

24:39.367 --> 24:41.533
Five?

24:41.533 --> 24:42.700
What do you mean, five?

24:42.700 --> 24:47.000
He said he killed five people.

24:47.000 --> 24:50.300
What exactly did the suspect say?

24:51.002 --> 24:52.512
Well...

25:02.767 --> 25:04.900
See that woman?

25:04.900 --> 25:08.033
Once I catch her, I'll let you go.

25:08.033 --> 25:09.493
How about it?

25:09.493 --> 25:11.467
Will you cooperate?

25:20.600 --> 25:22.400
Don't try anything stupid.

25:22.400 --> 25:24.433
I've killed five women.

25:24.433 --> 25:26.267
Killing one more

25:26.267 --> 25:28.067
is nothing.

25:28.067 --> 25:29.567
Hey, what the...

25:29.567 --> 25:30.933
He said five?

25:30.933 --> 25:32.167
Maybe that punk got it wrong?

25:32.167 --> 25:33.933
He wouldn't be mistaken
about something like that.

25:33.933 --> 25:36.700
Then, if there's one more victim,
why hasn't the body been found yet?

25:38.133 --> 25:40.167
- A missing person!
- A missing person!

25:40.167 --> 25:41.200
- Hey, rookie!
- Yes.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.667
Go get the missing persons list, now.

25:42.667 --> 25:43.667
- Yes, sir.
- Hurry up!

25:43.667 --> 25:45.300
Yes!

25:50.762 --> 25:52.433
[Investigation Division]

25:52.433 --> 25:54.667
I checked all recent missing persons cases.

25:54.667 --> 25:57.833
These three are the only ones that match.

25:57.833 --> 26:00.967
[Missing Person Report]

26:04.267 --> 26:06.767
This victim's build is larger
than the suspect's.

26:06.767 --> 26:08.467
He wouldn't have attacked recklessly.

26:08.467 --> 26:10.500
He might've mistaken her for a man too.

26:10.500 --> 26:13.900
Then it's one of these two.

26:13.900 --> 26:15.136
Tae Joo,

26:15.136 --> 26:16.433
who do you think it is?

26:16.433 --> 26:18.467
What exactly is going on here?

26:18.467 --> 26:20.433
Sir, you're here.

26:21.567 --> 26:26.467
I clearly told you to exclude Detective Kang
from all investigations.

26:26.467 --> 26:29.067
- Are you taking my words lightly?
- There's been

26:29.067 --> 26:31.167
another serial murder case.

26:32.200 --> 26:35.367
Couldn't think of a better excuse,
so you came up with that?

26:36.600 --> 26:38.080
Why?

26:38.080 --> 26:40.533
Did a body turn up somewhere?

26:40.533 --> 26:43.000
The suspect said it himself.

26:43.000 --> 26:45.567
He claimed he's committed five murders.

26:46.300 --> 26:48.096
It could be

26:48.096 --> 26:50.333
a lie or an exaggeration.

26:50.333 --> 26:53.100
Now you're seriously going to
let the suspect to play you?

26:53.100 --> 26:55.267
But we still have to look into it!

26:56.167 --> 26:57.200
We're the police!

26:57.200 --> 27:01.700
And what if you really end up getting played?

27:05.600 --> 27:07.392
Then

27:07.392 --> 27:09.400
I'll take responsibility.

27:11.233 --> 27:13.733
Of course, you'll take responsibility.

27:24.367 --> 27:27.567
Apologize to Jeon Kyeong Ho
and reach a settlement.

27:27.567 --> 27:29.833
Then I'll let you back in.

27:29.833 --> 27:34.333
Assault is prosecuted upon complaint,
so no complaint, no charges.

27:38.500 --> 27:41.300
I think I'm being pretty generous.

27:41.300 --> 27:43.900
Yeah, Detective Kang, just apologize.

27:43.900 --> 27:46.000
Sir, just...

27:48.933 --> 27:50.833
Tae Joo.

27:50.833 --> 27:52.567
Even if it's unfair, what can we do?

27:52.567 --> 27:54.500
Let's catch the killer first.

28:01.500 --> 28:03.360
So?

28:03.360 --> 28:05.700
You're going to apologize, right?

28:08.567 --> 28:10.200
No.

28:12.133 --> 28:14.533
Detective Kang.

28:16.167 --> 28:19.867
Jeez, you always take
the hard way for no reason.

28:20.600 --> 28:23.267
Let me make a proposal this time.

28:25.033 --> 28:27.733
If you let me handle the search,

28:27.733 --> 28:31.733
I'll resign regardless of the outcome.

28:31.733 --> 28:33.700
I'll submit to an investigation too.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.767
About the search operation,

28:36.767 --> 28:38.567
as you said, Prosecutor,

28:38.567 --> 28:42.833
if nothing turns up, the police
and prosecution will look like fools again.

28:42.833 --> 28:44.700
If nothing comes up,

28:44.700 --> 28:47.933
just pin it all on the guy
who's quitting anyway.

28:50.567 --> 28:53.967
If I'm a card you're throwing away,
make full use of me.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.800
So be it.

29:01.833 --> 29:04.367
Let's wrap it up that way, Mr. Cha.

29:12.544 --> 29:15.200
[Muwon District Prosecutors' Office,
Kangseng Branch]

29:55.639 --> 29:57.050
[Missing Person Report]

29:59.578 --> 30:01.850
[Potential Crime Scene
in the Choi In Sook Case]

30:03.667 --> 30:06.200
It's Choi In Sook.

30:06.200 --> 30:07.767
Are you sure?

30:07.767 --> 30:09.533
Yes, I'm sure.

30:12.733 --> 30:14.500
If it's Choi In Sook,
that's the third murder.

30:14.500 --> 30:17.600
Based on both the date
of the disappearance and the location,

30:17.600 --> 30:19.800
it fits the suspect's pattern more.

30:20.467 --> 30:22.067
I'm sure of it.

30:22.700 --> 30:24.500
Choi In Sook.

30:35.633 --> 30:37.267
Hello?

30:43.600 --> 30:45.233
Is anyone here?

30:53.067 --> 30:54.667
Anyone home?

30:55.667 --> 30:57.267
Who is it?

30:58.533 --> 31:00.133
Is that you, In Sook?

31:06.733 --> 31:11.100
That darn girl, so despicable.

31:11.100 --> 31:15.033
Leaving her sick mother and running off?
How could you call that human?

31:15.033 --> 31:16.833
She'll be punished by heaven!

31:16.833 --> 31:18.367
I must've been out of my darn mind,

31:18.367 --> 31:22.567
giving birth to a girl like that
and even celebrating it.

31:23.200 --> 31:27.500
Did your daughter say anything when she left?

31:28.333 --> 31:32.300
She said she was going
into town to buy me clothes.

31:32.300 --> 31:34.333
She could talk a good game.

31:39.667 --> 31:44.128
What does someone
who stays home all day need clothes for?

31:44.128 --> 31:47.067
Isn't that just an excuse to run away?

31:47.067 --> 31:48.767
That nonsense again!

31:48.767 --> 31:51.667
Why would I leave home?

31:51.667 --> 31:56.267
I know you're praying for me to die
as soon as possible.

31:56.267 --> 31:58.067
I know it all!

31:58.067 --> 32:01.933
It's getting cold soon.
You'll get sick if you don't bundle up.

32:01.933 --> 32:04.967
I'll just buy some clothes
and come right back, okay?

32:04.967 --> 32:08.367
Darn it, come home or don't, I don't care.

32:08.367 --> 32:12.367
Since I'm buying,
I might as well pick a nice one.

32:24.900 --> 32:26.567
That darn girl.

32:27.967 --> 32:31.133
Do you really think your daughter ran away?

32:31.133 --> 32:35.600
That must be why she still hasn't come back.

32:35.600 --> 32:40.333
But why are you looking for her now?

32:40.333 --> 32:43.433
Are you afraid
she died some sudden, violent death?

32:43.433 --> 32:47.033
No way! I don't know about anything else,

32:47.033 --> 32:49.700
but she was supposed to live a long life.

32:49.700 --> 32:52.433
A fortune-telling monk said so.

32:59.300 --> 33:01.733
If she was coming back from the market,

33:01.733 --> 33:05.633
she'd get off there and take this road.

33:05.633 --> 33:09.533
From the bus stop
to Choi In Sook's house is roughly

33:09.533 --> 33:11.600
500 meters.

33:11.600 --> 33:14.867
So that means we have to
search this whole area, right?

33:14.867 --> 33:17.233
We'll need at least two squads.

33:20.367 --> 33:22.887
If something really turns up,

33:22.887 --> 33:24.867
what happens then?

33:27.567 --> 33:29.033
A search operation?

33:29.033 --> 33:30.700
[Muwon District Prosecutors' Office]
What are you doing right now?

33:30.700 --> 33:33.700
Why are you teaming up with him
instead of getting rid of him?

33:33.700 --> 33:36.333
It's a pretty credible tip.

33:36.333 --> 33:38.167
And if nothing turns up,

33:38.167 --> 33:40.600
someone needs to take responsibility.

33:40.600 --> 33:43.000
It won't be too late to remove him then.

33:43.000 --> 33:47.500
So you take the credit
and dump the blame on someone else?

33:52.467 --> 33:54.144
By the way,

33:54.144 --> 33:56.300
you and Kang Tae Joo were classmates, right?

33:56.300 --> 33:58.567
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

34:00.200 --> 34:02.048
Being classmates

34:02.048 --> 34:05.667
doesn't mean the law bends for him, right?

34:13.533 --> 34:16.667
Isn't it nice to be outside after so long?

34:16.667 --> 34:20.700
The wheelchair is overkill.
I told you I can walk.

34:21.400 --> 34:23.800
Didn't you hear the doctor?

34:23.800 --> 34:26.633
You might feel dizzy after a while.

34:26.633 --> 34:29.200
What if you fall while walking?

34:29.200 --> 34:30.867
Jeez.

34:30.867 --> 34:33.800
How did we both end up
in the hospital like this?

34:33.800 --> 34:36.467
Jeon Kyeong Ho, or Jeon whatever...

34:36.467 --> 34:39.333
Just wait till I'm discharged.
I'll deal with him!

34:39.333 --> 34:41.567
Still, I like being here with you.

34:41.567 --> 34:43.133
It's nice taking walks together like this.

34:43.133 --> 34:45.300
What's so good about it?

34:45.300 --> 34:48.800
Look, we're the only patients
out here by ourselves.

34:49.900 --> 34:53.767
What can we do? Neither of us has a guardian.

34:53.767 --> 34:57.633
What do you mean? You've got your brother.

34:57.633 --> 34:59.584
I guess

34:59.584 --> 35:01.300
he's ashamed of me.

35:01.300 --> 35:03.033
He doesn't even visit.

35:06.700 --> 35:09.500
Didn't you hear?

35:14.500 --> 35:18.733
Your brother beat Jeon Kyeong Ho up badly.

35:18.733 --> 35:19.904
[Police officer arrested]
Still, he's going through a rough time

35:19.904 --> 35:21.867
[for assaulting an active teacher]
because of it.

35:23.033 --> 35:24.832
But

35:24.832 --> 35:27.200
he's not going to
get in serious trouble over this, is he?

35:27.200 --> 35:30.500
I didn't want to tell you
because I knew you'd worry.

35:30.500 --> 35:33.233
But I figured you should know.

35:33.900 --> 35:37.833
Your brother really cares about you

35:37.833 --> 35:39.900
so much.

36:03.633 --> 36:06.733
Where did you wander off to?
You're a patient.

36:07.633 --> 36:11.733
What brings you to me first
instead of Ji Won?

36:11.733 --> 36:14.067
How's Ji Won?

36:14.067 --> 36:16.433
If you're curious, go see her yourself.

36:21.633 --> 36:23.567
You know you're getting
discharged tomorrow, right?

36:23.567 --> 36:24.733
I'll be here on time.

36:24.733 --> 36:27.200
You're leaving already?

36:27.200 --> 36:30.000
Why? Got something to say?

36:31.633 --> 36:33.533
Tae Joo, you know...

36:39.633 --> 36:41.267
See you tomorrow.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.467
Who are you?

36:49.067 --> 36:50.733
Hey, don't you recognize me?

36:50.733 --> 36:52.367
Seo Ji...

36:53.700 --> 36:55.567
Wait, you guys said she was fine, but why...

36:55.567 --> 36:57.200
You!

36:58.133 --> 37:00.667
Are you really the Kang Tae Joo I knew?

37:00.667 --> 37:03.300
How could you lose the suspect!

37:03.300 --> 37:05.533
And why are you resigning?

37:05.533 --> 37:07.800
Well, even if I did sleep a little,

37:07.800 --> 37:11.667
what is all this?

37:11.667 --> 37:13.200
"Slept a little"?

37:13.200 --> 37:17.567
Wow, Seo Ji Won, awesome! You're back.

37:17.567 --> 37:19.933
There might still be a way.

37:19.933 --> 37:20.933
What way?

37:20.933 --> 37:22.843
Well,

37:22.843 --> 37:24.867
I'll let you know when I'm certain.

37:24.867 --> 37:29.733
I'm going to help you catch the suspect,
so just wait.

37:31.000 --> 37:32.900
I'm going to take a break for now.

37:33.567 --> 37:36.200
- Then what about the suspect?
- Am I the only cop?

37:36.200 --> 37:37.867
They'll catch him.

37:40.867 --> 37:42.800
You're not Kang Tae Joo, are you?

37:43.633 --> 37:46.800
Well, I'm just a little tired.

37:46.800 --> 37:49.100
Maybe because I'm getting old.

37:49.100 --> 37:51.133
You should stop doing dangerous stuff too.

37:51.133 --> 37:53.700
You really... You almost died this time!

37:53.700 --> 37:55.367
Why?

37:55.367 --> 37:58.600
You won't get hit in the head
all the time if I'm not around, right?

38:02.600 --> 38:04.200
Why?

38:05.267 --> 38:06.867
What?

38:08.867 --> 38:10.500
Knock some sense into me sometimes!

38:11.367 --> 38:13.633
Keep me on my toes.

38:13.633 --> 38:15.867
You're the only one who can do that.

38:44.288 --> 38:45.792
[Seo Ji Won]

39:43.034 --> 39:44.632
Who's there!

39:44.632 --> 39:46.019
Jeez!

39:49.700 --> 39:51.800
You punk!

39:51.800 --> 39:53.733
You startled me!

39:53.733 --> 39:56.600
I almost died!

39:56.600 --> 39:59.067
Then why did you sneak in like a thief?

39:59.067 --> 40:01.467
I thought you might be sleeping.

40:03.600 --> 40:05.567
What is it at this hour?

40:06.200 --> 40:07.733
Did you find the camera?

40:07.733 --> 40:10.667
- No.
- Still not?

40:10.667 --> 40:13.500
Anyway, this came to the newsroom.

40:14.700 --> 40:15.933
It seemed urgent.

40:15.933 --> 40:17.967
[For Reporter Seo Ji Won, deliver by today
From Tae Joo's friend]

40:20.367 --> 40:23.333
"Deliver by today, from Tae Joo's friend."

40:52.933 --> 40:55.333
What's this? It's not even an arrest.

40:55.333 --> 40:57.067
Whether a body is found or not,

40:57.067 --> 41:00.900
today will probably be
the last time we see each other.

41:00.900 --> 41:02.033
Are you satisfied now?

41:02.033 --> 41:03.967
Things turned out the way you wanted.

41:03.967 --> 41:07.067
- The way I wanted?
- You don't have to see my face anymore.

41:10.967 --> 41:13.333
Any last words?

41:15.400 --> 41:17.833
Make sure to catch that punk.

41:17.833 --> 41:19.900
I heard you're quite a capable prosecutor.

41:19.900 --> 41:24.033
I don't care if you get promoted
or become famous because of this case.

41:24.033 --> 41:27.233
Just catch that punk
before he kills more people.

41:32.633 --> 41:36.000
You haven't seen today's paper yet, have you?

41:36.000 --> 41:37.667
Read it.

41:38.833 --> 41:40.433
There.

41:44.633 --> 41:47.300
[Controversy over fairness due to
close friendship with the prosecutor]

41:47.300 --> 41:50.567
"Controversy over fairness
due to close friendship

41:50.567 --> 41:53.167
with the prosecutor."

41:53.867 --> 41:56.133
What kind of nonsense is this?

41:57.433 --> 42:00.833
So this is how we become friends?

42:02.933 --> 42:04.533
My friend!

42:09.733 --> 42:14.746
Now that things have come to this,
we really need to close your assault case.

42:14.746 --> 42:17.300
It's them!

42:17.300 --> 42:18.933
Making a big show of it?

42:18.933 --> 42:21.700
That way, rumors will spread
that we cut ties.

42:23.467 --> 42:25.967
Why didn't you indict Sergeant Kang Tae Joo?

42:25.967 --> 42:28.133
- Did your friendship play a part?
- Watch your expression when you get out.

42:28.133 --> 42:29.967
Act like my close friend.

42:29.967 --> 42:33.000
Just let me finish the search operation.

42:33.000 --> 42:34.267
Why should I?

42:34.267 --> 42:37.233
I don't see any reason to cut you some slack.

42:37.233 --> 42:39.400
I want to find her daughter.

42:39.400 --> 42:41.167
For Ms. Choi In Sook's mother.

42:42.900 --> 42:44.000
Huh?

42:44.000 --> 42:45.600
Isn't that Governor Jeon Tae Geun?

42:45.600 --> 42:48.000
Yes. Go take a picture!

42:48.967 --> 42:50.667
What's going on?

42:54.667 --> 42:56.233
Governor, please say a few words.

42:56.233 --> 42:57.600
Please say a few words.

42:57.600 --> 42:59.433
How do you feel?

42:59.433 --> 43:01.600
Could you please say something?

43:03.367 --> 43:06.033
How is your condition?

43:06.033 --> 43:08.333
As someone holding public office,

43:08.333 --> 43:10.800
I stayed silent until now
about my own family's matter,

43:10.800 --> 43:13.100
- fearing it might look like outside pressure.
- What a show he's putting on.

43:13.100 --> 43:15.433
But I can't stand this anymore.

43:15.433 --> 43:17.733
Look at my nephew here!

43:17.733 --> 43:20.333
He can't even move around properly
on his own.

43:20.333 --> 43:21.867
Right there!

43:21.867 --> 43:24.533
It's all because he was assaulted
by that police officer!

43:24.533 --> 43:28.033
And yet, how is it that a cop
who assaulted an innocent citizen

43:28.033 --> 43:30.233
faces no punishment whatsoever?

43:30.233 --> 43:31.467
It's unfair!

43:31.467 --> 43:34.033
I need a full eight weeks to recover.

43:34.033 --> 43:37.933
My students are looking for me
at school, but I can't go to them.

43:37.933 --> 43:40.700
Is this how the police behave?
Is this acceptable?

43:40.700 --> 43:43.867
I said I'd report in for questioning
after today's search is done!

43:43.867 --> 43:45.733
Why are you doing that?

43:45.733 --> 43:48.300
Are you the only cop in Korea?

43:48.300 --> 43:51.800
What are you doing? Why aren't you
arresting that violent cop right now?

43:51.800 --> 43:53.344
Yes!

43:54.880 --> 43:56.433
What is that?

43:56.433 --> 43:58.900
Kyeong Ho, are you really
on an eight-week recovery?

43:58.900 --> 44:01.000
Wait, is it even okay for you
to drink like this?

44:01.000 --> 44:02.600
Eight weeks? What nonsense!

44:02.600 --> 44:05.567
Getting the medical report isn't hard at all.

44:05.567 --> 44:10.000
I spent some money
to screw that detective over!

44:11.867 --> 44:15.077
You should've just done your usual nonsense.

44:15.077 --> 44:16.900
Why mess with a teacher?

44:16.900 --> 44:20.033
Mess with her? I didn't even touch her.

44:20.033 --> 44:22.967
She caught on first and came at me.

44:22.967 --> 44:24.800
Who does she think she is?

44:24.800 --> 44:28.500
Hey, is she that pretty?

44:30.933 --> 44:33.333
She looks

44:34.200 --> 44:36.600
even prettier than Miss Korea.

44:38.944 --> 44:40.160
No, no!

44:41.933 --> 44:43.900
- Hey! Turn that off now!
- He looks fine to me.

44:53.100 --> 44:54.700
Turn that off!

44:54.700 --> 44:56.800
What? Is he actually injured?

44:59.000 --> 45:01.800
It's a frame-up! This is fabricated!

45:01.800 --> 45:03.133
What exactly is fabricated?

45:03.133 --> 45:04.900
Let's get out of here quickly!

45:04.900 --> 45:07.300
Governor, please say a few words!

45:07.300 --> 45:09.433
Did you know about your nephew's crime?

45:09.433 --> 45:10.767
No, absolutely not!

45:10.767 --> 45:13.133
Have you ever pressured the investigation?

45:13.133 --> 45:16.567
A hostess' daughter
acting all high and mighty...

45:16.567 --> 45:18.133
- That punk!
- Tae Joo!

45:18.133 --> 45:19.800
Hey!

45:21.300 --> 45:23.300
Kang Tae Joo, you punk!

45:23.300 --> 45:25.567
Are you going to make the same mistake twice?

45:26.733 --> 45:29.033
You said you'd find Ms. Choi In Sook.

45:36.695 --> 45:38.113
He looks perfectly fine.

45:38.113 --> 45:39.967
He's perfectly fine. Please say a word.

45:39.967 --> 45:42.784
Mr. Jeon Kyeong Ho, please go now.

45:43.456 --> 45:44.767
Wait!

45:44.767 --> 45:47.767
Uncle, Uncle!

45:47.767 --> 45:49.400
We should go together...

45:59.800 --> 46:02.000
- So, what are we photographing?
- We'll begin the search operation.

46:02.000 --> 46:04.133
The search scene here.

46:05.067 --> 46:07.167
Do you really think we'll find anything here?

46:07.167 --> 46:08.767
Unfortunately, yes.

46:09.567 --> 46:11.900
Keep distance from the person
next to you and move slowly!

46:11.900 --> 46:12.900
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

46:12.900 --> 46:16.733
Don't just pass by the reeds, leaves,
or branches in the thicket.

46:16.733 --> 46:18.300
Examine them thoroughly! Got it?

46:18.300 --> 46:19.900
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

46:21.567 --> 46:25.600
Keep your distance! Move slowly!

46:25.600 --> 46:27.600
You're Prosecutor Cha Si Young, right?

46:27.600 --> 46:30.067
I'm Seo Ji Won, a reporter
from Kangseng Daily.

46:30.067 --> 46:32.900
You were impressive today.

46:34.233 --> 46:37.867
I received a tape from an anonymous tipster,

46:37.867 --> 46:40.233
but I have no idea who sent it.

46:41.567 --> 46:44.600
Was it you who called
Jeon Kyeong Ho and Governor Jeon?

46:45.500 --> 46:47.400
That was nothing.

46:48.400 --> 46:50.200
Kim, did you wash the car properly?

46:50.200 --> 46:52.333
Yes, I cleaned it thoroughly.

46:52.333 --> 46:55.167
Did you know Sergeant Kang Tae Joo
was deployed on the operation today?

46:55.167 --> 46:56.600
It seemed like a fairly important operation.

46:56.600 --> 46:59.533
If he makes a contribution,
he might avoid disciplinary action.

47:03.167 --> 47:07.667
Whoever that tipster was,
they probably expected

47:07.667 --> 47:10.700
that you would blow it wide open, Ms. Seo.

47:15.600 --> 47:17.600
I didn't know you were classmates
with Detective Kang.

47:17.600 --> 47:19.400
You must have been quite close, huh?

47:21.367 --> 47:25.567
I had the chance to get close,
but I missed it.

47:25.567 --> 47:29.056
I heard you're close with Detective Kang.
How did you become friends?

47:30.500 --> 47:35.333
Well, we grew up in the same neighborhood
since we were kids.

47:35.333 --> 47:37.167
Since you were kids?

47:38.400 --> 47:40.500
Am I already too late?

47:45.400 --> 47:47.100
I found something.

47:47.100 --> 47:48.833
Where?

47:48.833 --> 47:50.633
Over here! This way!

48:07.500 --> 48:09.533
Preserve the scene.

48:09.533 --> 48:11.367
And call the forensics team.

48:34.767 --> 48:38.500
[Choi In Sook]

48:54.800 --> 48:57.533
You finally came back, my girl.

48:59.400 --> 49:01.400
You must've suffered.

49:03.600 --> 49:07.767
How wronged you must
have felt all this time...

49:09.000 --> 49:12.467
I didn't know I was running late.

49:13.567 --> 49:17.700
And I just kept scolding you for being late.

49:19.133 --> 49:21.000
I was wrong,

49:23.767 --> 49:25.433
my baby.

49:29.300 --> 49:33.267
Don't go anywhere anymore.

49:33.267 --> 49:35.833
Stay with me.

49:41.167 --> 49:42.767
Mom.

49:43.467 --> 49:45.333
Have you been well?

49:46.933 --> 49:48.900
I missed you.

51:09.300 --> 51:13.233
[Kangseng Daily]

51:13.233 --> 51:16.600
I'm back.

51:18.733 --> 51:19.933
What is it?

51:19.933 --> 51:23.833
Ms. Seo found the film
with the Kangseng serial killer on it.

51:23.833 --> 51:25.833
- What?
- It's being developed now.

51:25.833 --> 51:28.667
Isn't that the biggest scoop?

51:28.667 --> 51:31.200
But I don't think
the photo will come out alright.

51:31.200 --> 51:34.100
Don't jinx it. Shut up!

51:36.933 --> 51:38.333
[Film in development
When light is on, no entry]

51:38.333 --> 51:40.400
Oh, it came out. It came out.

51:42.167 --> 51:43.800
It came out?

51:56.467 --> 51:57.467
Thanks for the meal!

51:57.467 --> 52:01.033
Eat up. It's an extra-large special,
on the house today.

52:01.033 --> 52:03.800
What's gotten into you? You're usually
strict about paying even with friends.

52:03.800 --> 52:07.167
You must've had a really hard time
because of Sun Young.

52:07.167 --> 52:11.133
Now that Sun Young's cleared her name
and the scandal's all gone...

52:11.133 --> 52:13.067
What are you talking about?

52:13.067 --> 52:15.267
You really didn't know anything?

52:15.267 --> 52:18.633
It was even on the front page
that Tae Joo beat that guy up.

52:18.633 --> 52:20.267
It's probably that guy.

52:20.267 --> 52:23.033
The one who took Sun Young in a Grandeur.

52:42.800 --> 52:44.433
Ki Beom...

52:55.200 --> 52:57.133
Why didn't you tell me?

52:59.867 --> 53:02.667
Even if no one else knows, I should've known.

53:02.667 --> 53:06.200
I'm your groom, and you're my bride!

53:09.033 --> 53:11.800
- Ki Beom...
- Where is that punk now?

53:14.300 --> 53:16.000
Let's break up.

53:18.000 --> 53:19.633
What?

53:24.467 --> 53:26.400
Let's break up.

53:45.967 --> 53:47.300
You just got here,
and you're already leaving?

53:47.300 --> 53:49.067
Yes, I'm leaving.

53:49.067 --> 53:52.600
Take care. I won't walk you out.

53:52.600 --> 53:54.233
No need for that.

53:59.667 --> 54:02.133
I'll just leave after causing trouble, sir.

54:03.367 --> 54:05.157
You really worked hard.

54:05.157 --> 54:07.100
You've been through a lot.

54:54.200 --> 54:57.233
[Stepping away for a moment]

55:01.200 --> 55:03.400
My art tube...

55:13.367 --> 55:15.200
- Oh my!
- Uh, you scared me!

55:15.200 --> 55:17.767
You startled me!

55:17.767 --> 55:19.328
What are you doing?

55:19.328 --> 55:21.600
I left something behind.

55:21.600 --> 55:23.467
What about you, sir?

55:23.467 --> 55:24.600
What did you leave behind?

55:24.600 --> 55:26.067
My art tube.

55:26.067 --> 55:28.767
My drawings are in it.

55:28.767 --> 55:31.433
So why are you here?

55:31.433 --> 55:34.133
I'm friends with the owner.

55:34.133 --> 55:37.467
Huh? With Andy Lau?

55:38.133 --> 55:40.467
He's my friend's younger brother.

55:40.467 --> 55:43.267
Oh, okay.

55:43.267 --> 55:46.400
Your tone is a bit off.

55:46.400 --> 55:48.167
Don't you have a killer to catch?

55:48.167 --> 55:50.100
When are you ever going to
catch him at this rate?

55:50.100 --> 55:52.700
Why does everyone bring up the killer
whenever they see me?

55:52.700 --> 55:54.304
Well...

55:54.304 --> 55:57.067
I'm not a cop anymore. I quit.

55:57.800 --> 56:00.900
Then what about the killer?

56:00.900 --> 56:02.967
The other police officers will...

56:03.600 --> 56:05.700
You just focus on your studies.

56:05.700 --> 56:08.167
Go home early, and...

56:09.333 --> 56:13.433
If you see anything like a scarecrow
at night, just run, okay?

56:13.433 --> 56:15.233
Why?

56:15.233 --> 56:17.967
Because it might not actually be a scarecrow.

56:17.967 --> 56:19.833
Remember what I said.

56:21.100 --> 56:22.700
Why aren't you answering?

56:23.367 --> 56:25.233
Well...

56:25.233 --> 56:28.600
Can't you not quit being a cop?

56:28.600 --> 56:32.033
I want you to catch him yourself, sir.

56:34.867 --> 56:36.167
Oh, this is just, well...

56:36.167 --> 56:37.233
Jeez.

56:37.233 --> 56:39.133
If only grown-ups' business

56:39.133 --> 56:42.767
were as simple as flipping pancakes...

56:44.900 --> 56:46.667
What's this?

56:46.667 --> 56:48.233
It's a bribe.

56:48.233 --> 56:52.467
When you eat it,
just think it over twice more, okay?

56:52.467 --> 56:54.100
Bye!

56:55.667 --> 56:59.833
Giving a bribe to a guy who got fired?
What a waste.

57:19.067 --> 57:20.800
Stop staring at it, okay?

57:20.800 --> 57:23.233
Do you think staring
will bring back your focus?

57:23.233 --> 57:27.200
Jeez, I thought we finally
got a real scoop this time.

57:28.667 --> 57:30.467
Let's run it as is.

57:30.467 --> 57:31.533
As is?

57:31.533 --> 57:33.533
I can't even make out the eyes,
nose, or mouth.

57:33.533 --> 57:35.800
You never know. Someone might recognize him.

57:35.800 --> 57:38.500
No way.

57:38.500 --> 57:41.133
At least one person will!
The suspect himself.

57:41.133 --> 57:45.533
Even if it doesn't identify him,
it can still pressure the suspect.

57:45.533 --> 57:48.167
"You've been caught on camera."

57:51.733 --> 57:53.667
Let's break up.

57:54.800 --> 57:56.733
Ki Beom!

57:56.733 --> 57:58.467
Ki Beom, are you okay?

57:58.467 --> 58:00.100
Stop it.

58:00.867 --> 58:03.467
What's wrong with you today?

58:03.467 --> 58:04.567
Hey.

58:04.567 --> 58:06.633
If you're tired, go home first.
I'll handle it.

58:06.633 --> 58:07.733
No, we have a lot to tidy up.

58:07.733 --> 58:10.867
Go home first.
We're almost at closing time anyway.

58:10.867 --> 58:13.667
- I'll do it.
- Jeez, just listen to me.

58:17.467 --> 58:20.000
Excuse me.

58:25.100 --> 58:26.333
Is this yours?

58:26.333 --> 58:29.167
Yes, thank you.

58:29.167 --> 58:32.200
It's late. Do you think
you can go by yourself?

58:32.200 --> 58:35.333
I'm fine. It's just a quick bus ride.

58:35.333 --> 58:37.533
Goodbye.

58:37.533 --> 58:39.367
Goodbye.

58:45.100 --> 58:49.767
She should've gone home earlier.
It's really dangerous these days.

58:51.400 --> 58:54.100
Huh? It's raining.

59:03.267 --> 59:05.800
What? It's a scarecrow.

59:06.433 --> 59:09.600
If you see anything
like a scarecrow at night, just run.

59:10.800 --> 59:13.233
Because it might not actually be a scarecrow.

01:00:44.633 --> 01:00:45.667
Yes, hello?

01:00:45.667 --> 01:00:46.900
Sir.

01:00:46.900 --> 01:00:50.067
Well, a body...

01:00:50.067 --> 01:00:51.733
It's another murder.

01:00:55.400 --> 01:00:57.333
Why are you telling me this?

01:00:57.967 --> 01:01:00.867
Did you forget I quit? I'm hanging up.

01:01:00.867 --> 01:01:02.567
The dead girl

01:01:04.700 --> 01:01:06.400
is Min Ji.

01:01:08.967 --> 01:01:10.600
Who?

01:01:13.333 --> 01:01:15.500
Kang Tae Joo!

01:01:15.500 --> 01:01:18.300
- Hey, you...
- Why are you here?

01:01:18.300 --> 01:01:19.900
Hey!

01:01:19.900 --> 01:01:21.333
Kang Tae Joo!

01:01:21.333 --> 01:01:23.233
Sir.

01:01:23.233 --> 01:01:25.433
- Hey, stop him! Keep him away!
- Block him, you punks!

01:01:25.433 --> 01:01:26.500
- Keep him away! Block him!
- Sir.

01:01:26.500 --> 01:01:29.000
- Kang Tae Joo!
- Hey, stop him!

01:01:29.667 --> 01:01:30.800
Hey, you punk!

01:01:30.800 --> 01:01:31.800
Hey, you!

01:01:31.800 --> 01:01:34.167
What are you doing here?

01:01:34.167 --> 01:01:35.800
Kang Tae Joo.

01:02:05.067 --> 01:02:09.267
[Kim Min Ji]

01:02:27.706 --> 01:02:29.200
We said we'd handle it.

01:02:29.200 --> 01:02:32.192
What are you doing here? Go! We'll handle it.

01:02:33.082 --> 01:02:35.000
You really need to leave.

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:37.344
So why did you...

01:02:37.344 --> 01:02:41.167
Hey, your nose is bleeding.

01:02:41.914 --> 01:02:44.567
What's going on with you?

01:02:44.567 --> 01:02:45.600
Kang Tae Joo!

01:02:45.600 --> 01:02:47.200
Hey!

01:02:48.058 --> 01:02:49.344
Kang Tae Joo!

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:51.800
Kang Tae Joo!

01:02:51.800 --> 01:02:52.800
Take him away, now.

01:02:52.800 --> 01:02:54.433
Kang Tae Joo!

01:02:54.433 --> 01:02:56.654
Someone get him out of here!

01:02:56.654 --> 01:02:59.000
Hey, bring a stretcher.

01:02:59.000 --> 01:03:02.067
A life's mission?

01:03:02.067 --> 01:03:05.933
How did you end up getting into that,

01:03:05.933 --> 01:03:08.133
your life's mission?

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:10.667
It might have started

01:03:12.967 --> 01:03:15.433
that day, I guess.

01:03:21.200 --> 01:03:23.900
This time, I'll be the one asking.

01:03:24.533 --> 01:03:28.967
Was it you who ruined my mission,
Mr. Lee Yong Woo?

01:03:35.500 --> 01:03:37.233
Mr. Lee Yong Woo.

01:03:44.533 --> 01:03:46.633
Oh, come on.

01:03:46.633 --> 01:03:51.200
Repeating the same thing isn't fun.

01:03:51.200 --> 01:03:53.200
Alright.

01:03:53.200 --> 01:03:58.000
Since it's something I did anyway,
I'll lay it all out.

01:03:58.000 --> 01:03:59.600
Are you saying you'll confess?

01:03:59.600 --> 01:04:01.967
It's going to be a pretty long story.

01:04:01.967 --> 01:04:04.967
You've got enough time, right?

01:04:04.967 --> 01:04:06.867
Of course.

01:04:12.633 --> 01:04:14.867
Where should we start?

01:04:14.867 --> 01:04:16.800
But

01:04:16.800 --> 01:04:19.133
please tell me your story too.

01:04:19.133 --> 01:04:21.533
It's no fun if I'm the only one talking.

01:04:21.533 --> 01:04:23.167
You tell yours,

01:04:23.167 --> 01:04:24.933
and I'll tell mine.

01:04:24.933 --> 01:04:26.496
That way,

01:04:26.496 --> 01:04:29.567
we can complete our story.

01:04:32.233 --> 01:04:33.933
"Our story"?

01:04:33.933 --> 01:04:36.033
Yes.

01:04:36.033 --> 01:04:37.633
Ours.

01:05:14.267 --> 01:05:16.067
I've got to catch that punk.

01:05:16.067 --> 01:05:17.500
Let's catch him together.

01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:19.233
[National Saemaeul Leaders Convention]
So that's why you came back?

01:05:19.233 --> 01:05:20.800
Unbelievable, Seo Ji Won.

01:05:20.800 --> 01:05:22.867
We didn't even see a strand of his hair.

01:05:22.867 --> 01:05:24.400
Does that make any sense?

01:05:24.400 --> 01:05:26.667
You don't even know
what kind of woman she is, do you?

01:05:26.667 --> 01:05:30.100
- You're being fooled too.
- I said shut up!

01:05:30.100 --> 01:05:32.600
Jeon Kyeong Ho again? Seriously?

01:05:32.600 --> 01:05:36.233
Thinking back now, it was all bait.

01:05:37.200 --> 01:05:39.400
Kang Sun Young!

01:05:39.400 --> 01:05:41.033
Who's there?
